          "exact": "For computers whose power is supplied by a battery (e.g. laptops and smartphones), or for very long/large calculations (e.g. supercomputers), other measures of interest are:\n\nDirect power consumption: power needed directly to operate the computer.\nIndirect power consumption: power needed for cooling, lighting, etc."
